#: ../../source/has-values_README.md:87
msgid ""
"[has-value](https://www.npmjs.com/package/has-value): Returns true if a "
"value exists, false if empty. Works with deeply nested values using… "
"[more](https://github.com/jonschlinkert/has-value) | "
"[homepage](https://github.com/jonschlinkert/has-value \"Returns true if a"
" value exists, false if empty. Works with deeply nested values using "
"object paths.\")"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/has-values_README.md:88
msgid ""
"[is-number](https://www.npmjs.com/package/is-number): Returns true if the"
" value is a number. comprehensive tests. | "
"[homepage](https://github.com/jonschlinkert/is-number \"Returns true if "
"the value is a number. comprehensive tests.\")"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/has-values_README.md:89
msgid ""
"[is-plain-object](https://www.npmjs.com/package/is-plain-object): Returns"
" true if an object was created by the `Object` constructor. | "
"[homepage](https://github.com/jonschlinkert/is-plain-object \"Returns "
"true if an object was created by the `Object` constructor.\")"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/has-values_README.md:90
msgid ""
"[isobject](https://www.npmjs.com/package/isobject): Returns true if the "
"value is an object and not an array or null. | "
"[homepage](https://github.com/jonschlinkert/isobject \"Returns true if "
"the value is an object and not an array or null.\")"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/has-values_README.md:91
msgid ""
"[kind-of](https://www.npmjs.com/package/kind-of): Get the native type of "
"a value. | [homepage](https://github.com/jonschlinkert/kind-of \"Get the "
"native type of a value.\")"
msgstr ""

